@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Account API
	Testing Koroneiki Account API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following "Code" values
	| KORAUTO1 |
	| KORAUTO2 |

Scenario: Create and view account
	Koroneiki accounts created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | 
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry              | Automotive                               |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Sold By               | Liferay US                               |
	| Status                | Approved                                 |
	| Tier                  | Regular                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |

